      ],
      "en": "Joshua the son of Nun, the servant of the LORD, died, being one hundred ten years old.",
      "ko": "여호와의 종 눈의 아들 여호수아가 일백 십세에 죽으매",
      "source_text_hash": "ab689a68721faccdb1be482675df08e2060e3adb87936ce87a12e49b3923492a",
      "translation_text_hash": "413ef8b827bc40e8fa12190a8217560b1e4662d1495269336a8faa91bd482fa7",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
