      "en": "They buried him in the border of his inheritance in Timnath Heres, in the hill country of Ephraim, on the north of the mountain of Gaash.",
      "ko": "무리가 그의 기업의 경내 에브라임 산지 가아스산 북 딤낫 헤레스에 장사하였고",
      "source_text_hash": "2f9f110a27001e9565659f66a448a37d9ac0662b90460e6ca73f6ac29dc50f2f",
      "translation_text_hash": "0a7d5033e444acb3f221566774f9a4cdb8ecdb793991a115367e5e9fc26ecef1",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
